      {
        "id": "p132-q58-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "The sum of two odd functions is odd.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Odd.\n\nFor $h(x)=f(x)+g(x)$, oddness gives $h(-x)=-f(x)-g(x)=-h(x)$.",
          "worked": "Let $h(x)=f(x)+g(x)$ on the common domain of $f$ and $g$. Since both functions are odd,\n\n$$\\begin{align*}h(-x)&=f(-x)+g(-x)\\\\h(-x)&=-f(x)-g(x)\\\\h(-x)&=-\\bigl(f(x)+g(x)\\bigr)\\\\h(-x)&=-h(x).\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore the sum is odd.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      },
      {
        "id": "p132-q58-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "The product of two even functions is even.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Even.\n\nFor $h(x)=f(x)g(x)$, evenness gives $h(-x)=f(x)g(x)=h(x)$.",
          "worked": "Let $h(x)=f(x)g(x)$ on the common domain of $f$ and $g$. Since both functions are even,\n\n$$\\begin{align*}h(-x)&=f(-x)g(-x)\\\\h(-x)&=f(x)g(x)\\\\h(-x)&=h(x).\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore the product is even.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p132-q58-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "The product of two odd functions is even.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Even.\n\nFor $h(x)=f(x)g(x)$, oddness gives $h(-x)=[-f(x)][-g(x)]=h(x)$.",
          "worked": "Let $h(x)=f(x)g(x)$ on the common domain of $f$ and $g$. Since both functions are odd,\n\n$$\\begin{align*}h(-x)&=f(-x)g(-x)\\\\h(-x)&=\\bigl[-f(x)\\bigr]\\bigl[-g(x)\\bigr]\\\\h(-x)&=f(x)g(x)\\\\h(-x)&=h(x).\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore the product is even.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      }
    ]
